cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PUFFER, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "PUFFER: Incremental Fuzzy Deduplication for Continuously Evolving Corpora"
abstract: >-
  PUFFER (Provenance-aware Updatable Fuzzy Filtering for Evolving Repositories)
  is a CPU-first engine for incremental MinHash-LSH fuzzy deduplication of
  continuously growing corpora, with exact band-key membership, bounded memory,
  deterministic retry, and dataset-scoped withdrawal.
type: software
